 $x=2$” reads\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{{x}^{2}=4}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{only if}\\,\\underbrace{x=2}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option “${x}^{2}=4$ if $x=2$” reads\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{{x}^{2}=4}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{if}\\,\\underbrace{x=2}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $P(x)⇒Q(x).$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}^{2}=4$ if $x=2$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186421146 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198284 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b24ae815-5706-5b65-bab8-2d67f8405c9c" :knowledge-point/title "\"Whenever\", and \"Provided That\""}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c97a67bd-0eab-522a-b912-f7d7b1965ac9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474614} {:answer/id #uuid "9e408c6c-7a9d-5fc8-8352-2e6d614fc5fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474615}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c97a67bd-0eab-522a-b912-f7d7b1965ac9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474614} :answer-field/id #uuid "bdba47ab-ad3c-5f97-851d-51e76579632c" :answer-field/key "Whenever $|x|<1,$ then $0\\le x<1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475233} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "327a00dd-4553-507d-8ed6-59817b49dc98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474616} {:answer/id #uuid "668c2ea7-19db-5f8f-a0a1-559b819f0c5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474617}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "327a00dd-4553-507d-8ed6-59817b49dc98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident 