0\\le x<1$ whenever $|x|<1$” reads\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{0\\le x<1}_{P(x)}\\,\\text{whenever}\\,\\underbrace{|x|<1}_{Q(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $Q(x)⇒P(x).$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- Option “$|x|<1,$ provided that $0\\le x<1$” reads\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{|x|<1\\text{,}}_{Q(x)}\\,\\text{provided that}\\,\\underbrace{0\\le x<1}_{P(x)}\n$$\n\nwhich corresponds to $P(x)⇒Q(x).$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “$|x|<1,$ provided that $0\\le x<1$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186421148 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198284 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b24ae815-5706-5b65-bab8-2d67f8405c9c" :knowledge-point/title "\"Whenever\", and \"Provided That\""}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ec589ad-6e14-5afe-b705-86a37c1f6e8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474602} {:answer/id #uuid "1d21f13a-49f5-5984-995b-6f89f3b94ef4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474603}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d21f13a-49f5-5984-995b-6f89f3b94ef4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474603} :answer-field/id #uuid "3b4b6cfc-23cb-5eb0-8919-b43d591ffb35" :answer-field/key "Whenever $4\\,|\\,x,$ then $x$ is composite" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475227} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ca9a59df-fa84-52b0-a9af-915827efaab3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474604} {:answer/id #uuid "728b0d74-df98-5671-8d8a-5feb2fee7585" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474605}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca9a59df-fa