$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $-6\\in [5]$ because $11\\,|\\,(-6-5)\\,✓$\n\n- $-6\\in [-17]$ because $11\\,|\\,(-6+17)\\,✓$\n\n- $-6\\notin [-8]$ because $11∤(-6+8)\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $[5]$; $[-17]$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186421722 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152256 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3601ac83-0800-567a-9a0d-4d5c37cef413" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to an Equivalence Class"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3632d098-f94e-51af-ba8c-9b4b134a9ea5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474696} {:answer/id #uuid "c3ea6f3f-cee2-59b7-b3e1-909b889584a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474697}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c3ea6f3f-cee2-59b7-b3e1-909b889584a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474697} :answer-field/id #uuid "e107390e-8067-57cd-83d7-7adfade8aa57" :answer-field/key "$2\\pi $" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475274} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "583bd508-a244-583e-9b24-df1802c34906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474698} {:answer/id #uuid "4c48ad0e-93b4-5198-b57e-b3d98c6acf21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474699}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "583bd508-a244-583e-9b24-df1802c34906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474698} :answer-field/id #uuid "bd248b96-48cb-5aa0-9b1